{"seq":1,"slug":"ml-overview","title":"机器学习概览","url":"/l-doc-books/h/ai-llm/machine-learning/foundations/ml-overview","wordCount":1210,"readingTime":5,"html":"<h1 id=\"机器学习概览\">机器学习概览</h1><h2 id=\"什么是机器学习\">什么是机器学习</h2><p>机器学习（Machine Learning, ML）是人工智能的一个分支，它让计算机能够通过<strong>数据驱动</strong>的方式自动学习规律和模式，而无需被显式编程。传统软件依赖人工编写的规则，而机器学习系统从数据中归纳出规则，并不断优化自身的预测能力。</p>\n<pre class=\"mermaid\" data-diagram-type=\"flowchart\" data-source=\"flowchart LR&#10;    A[&quot;传统编程&quot;] --&gt; B[&quot;输入:规则 + 数据&quot;]&#10;    B --&gt; C[&quot;输出:结果&quot;]&#10;    D[&quot;机器学习&quot;] --&gt; E[&quot;输入:数据 + 结果&quot;]&#10;    E --&gt; F[&quot;输出:规则(模型)&quot;]\">flowchart LR\n    A[\"传统编程\"] --&gt; B[\"输入:规则 + 数据\"]\n    B --&gt; C[\"输出:结果\"]\n    D[\"机器学习\"] --&gt; E[\"输入:数据 + 结果\"]\n    E --&gt; F[\"输出:规则(模型)\"]</pre><p>Tom Mitchell 于 1997 年给出了经典定义：</p>\n<blockquote>\n<p><strong>提示：</strong> 如果一个程序在任务 T 上的性能 P 随着经验 E 的增加而提升，那么就称该程序从经验中学习。</p>\n</blockquote>\n<hr>\n<h2 id=\"核心概念\">核心概念</h2><p>机器学习围绕四个相互关联的概念展开：</p>\n<ul>\n<li><strong>模型（Model）</strong>：从数据中学到的映射函数 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>f</mi><mo>:</mo><mi>X</mi><mo>→</mo><mi>y</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">f: X \\rightarrow y</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.8889em;vertical-align:-0.1944em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.1076em;\">f</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span><span class=\"mrel\">:</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.6833em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0785em;\">X</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span><span class=\"mrel\">→</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.625em;vertical-align:-0.1944em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0359em;\">y</span></span></span></span></span>，是机器学习系统的最终产物。上面 Mitchell 定义中的&quot;性能 P 随经验 E 提升&quot;，说的就是模型在任务 T 上不断逼近真实规律的过程。</li>\n<li><strong>训练（Training）</strong>：在给定任务与性能度量下，从数据中求解最优模型参数的过程，对应工作流程中的&quot;训练与调优&quot;环节。</li>\n<li><strong>泛化（Generalization）</strong>：模型在未见过的数据上仍然表现良好的能力。这才是机器学习的真正目标——训练集上的表现只是手段，测试集上的表现才是衡量标准。</li>\n<li><strong>偏差-方差（Bias-Variance）</strong>：解释泛化误差来源的分解框架，模型过简单导致高偏差（欠拟合），过复杂导致高方差（过拟合）。</li>\n</ul>\n<p>这四者构成一条主线：<strong>训练</strong>用数据拟合<strong>模型</strong>，<strong>偏差-方差</strong>决定它能否<strong>泛化</strong>。后面每个章节——无论是具体算法还是训练技巧——都在回答这条主线上的某一段问题。</p>\n<hr>\n<h2 id=\"机器学习的三大类型\">机器学习的三大类型</h2><p>机器学习根据训练数据的标注方式，可划分为三大主要类型：</p>\n<table>\n<thead>\n<tr>\n<th>类型</th>\n<th>数据特点</th>\n<th>目标</th>\n<th>典型算法</th>\n</tr>\n</thead>\n<tbody><tr>\n<td>监督学习</td>\n<td>含标签（label）</td>\n<td>学习输入到输出的映射</td>\n<td>线性回归、SVM、神经网络</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>无监督学习</td>\n<td>无标签</td>\n<td>发现数据的内在结构</td>\n<td>K-Means、PCA、自编码器</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>强化学习</td>\n<td>奖励信号</td>\n<td>学习最优决策策略</td>\n<td>Q-Learning、PPO、A3C</td>\n</tr>\n</tbody></table>\n<pre class=\"mermaid\" data-diagram-type=\"flowchart\" data-source=\"flowchart TD&#10;    ML[&quot;机器学习&quot;]&#10;    ML --&gt; SL[&quot;监督学习&lt;br/&gt;Supervised&quot;]&#10;    ML --&gt; UL[&quot;无监督学习&lt;br/&gt;Unsupervised&quot;]&#10;    ML --&gt; RL[&quot;强化学习&lt;br/&gt;Reinforcement&quot;]&#10;    SL --&gt; CL[&quot;分类 Classification&quot;]&#10;    SL --&gt; RG[&quot;回归 Regression&quot;]&#10;    UL --&gt; CLU[&quot;聚类 Clustering&quot;]&#10;    UL --&gt; DR[&quot;降维 Reduction&quot;]&#10;    RL --&gt; PO[&quot;策略优化 Policy&quot;]&#10;    RL --&gt; VF[&quot;价值函数 Value&quot;]\">flowchart TD\n    ML[\"机器学习\"]\n    ML --&gt; SL[\"监督学习&lt;br/&gt;Supervised\"]\n    ML --&gt; UL[\"无监督学习&lt;br/&gt;Unsupervised\"]\n    ML --&gt; RL[\"强化学习&lt;br/&gt;Reinforcement\"]\n    SL --&gt; CL[\"分类 Classification\"]\n    SL --&gt; RG[\"回归 Regression\"]\n    UL --&gt; CLU[\"聚类 Clustering\"]\n    UL --&gt; DR[\"降维 Reduction\"]\n    RL --&gt; PO[\"策略优化 Policy\"]\n    RL --&gt; VF[\"价值函数 Value\"]</pre><h3 id=\"监督学习\">监督学习</h3><p>监督学习使用带有标签的训练数据，模型学习从特征 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>X</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">X</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.6833em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0785em;\">X</span></span></span></span></span> 到标签 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>y</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">y</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.625em;vertical-align:-0.1944em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0359em;\">y</span></span></span></span></span> 的映射函数 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>f</mi><mo>:</mo><mi>X</mi><mo>→</mo><mi>y</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">f: X \\rightarrow y</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.8889em;vertical-align:-0.1944em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.1076em;\">f</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span><span class=\"mrel\">:</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.6833em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0785em;\">X</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span><span class=\"mrel\">→</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.625em;vertical-align:-0.1944em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0359em;\">y</span></span></span></span></span>。</p>\n<div class=\"code-block-wrapper\" data-lang=\"python\" data-code=\"from sklearn.linear_model import LinearRegression&#10;import numpy as np&#10;&#10;X = np.array([[1], [2], [3], [4], [5]])&#10;y = np.array([2.1, 3.9, 6.2, 7.8, 10.1])&#10;&#10;model = LinearRegression()&#10;model.fit(X, y)&#10;&#10;prediction = model.predict([[6]])&#10;print(f&quot;预测值: {prediction[0]:.2f}&quot;)\"><pre class=\"shiki shiki-themes github-light github-dark\" style=\"background-color:#fff;--shiki-dark-bg:#24292e;color:#24292e;--shiki-dark:#e1e4e8\" tabindex=\"0\"><code><span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">from</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> sklearn.linear_model </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">import</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> LinearRegression</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">import</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> numpy </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">as</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> np</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">X </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">=</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> np.array([[</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">1</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">], [</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">2</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">], [</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">3</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">], [</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">4</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">], [</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">5</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">]])</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">y </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">=</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> np.array([</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">2.1</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">, </span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">3.9</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">, </span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">6.2</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">, </span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">7.8</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">, </span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">10.1</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">])</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">model </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">=</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> LinearRegression()</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">model.fit(X, y)</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">prediction </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">=</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> model.predict([[</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">6</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">]])</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">print</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">(</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">f</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">\"预测值: </span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">{</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">prediction[</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">0</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">]</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">:.2f</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">}</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">\"</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">)</span></span></code></pre></div><h3 id=\"无监督学习\">无监督学习</h3><p>无监督学习没有标签信息，模型需要自行发现数据中的模式和结构。</p>\n<h3 id=\"强化学习\">强化学习</h3><p>强化学习中，智能体（Agent）通过与环境交互获得奖励信号，学习在每个状态下选择最优动作的策略。</p>\n<hr>\n<h2 id=\"机器学习工作流程\">机器学习工作流程</h2><p>一个完整的机器学习项目通常遵循以下流程：</p>\n<pre class=\"mermaid\" data-diagram-type=\"flowchart\" data-source=\"flowchart LR&#10;    A[&quot;问题定义&quot;] --&gt; B[&quot;数据收集&quot;]&#10;    B --&gt; C[&quot;数据预处理&quot;]&#10;    C --&gt; D[&quot;特征工程&quot;]&#10;    D --&gt; E[&quot;模型选择&quot;]&#10;    E --&gt; F[&quot;训练与调优&quot;]&#10;    F --&gt; G[&quot;评估验证&quot;]&#10;    G --&gt; H[&quot;部署上线&quot;]&#10;    H --&gt; I[&quot;监控迭代&quot;]&#10;    I --&gt;|&quot;反馈&quot;| C\">flowchart LR\n    A[\"问题定义\"] --&gt; B[\"数据收集\"]\n    B --&gt; C[\"数据预处理\"]\n    C --&gt; D[\"特征工程\"]\n    D --&gt; E[\"模型选择\"]\n    E --&gt; F[\"训练与调优\"]\n    F --&gt; G[\"评估验证\"]\n    G --&gt; H[\"部署上线\"]\n    H --&gt; I[\"监控迭代\"]\n    I --&gt;|\"反馈\"| C</pre><ol>\n<li><strong>问题定义</strong>：明确业务目标，确定是分类、回归还是聚类问题</li>\n<li><strong>数据收集</strong>：获取足够质量和数量的数据</li>\n<li><strong>数据预处理</strong>：清洗、归一化、处理缺失值</li>\n<li><strong>特征工程</strong>：提取和选择对预测有帮助的特征</li>\n<li><strong>模型选择</strong>：根据问题类型和数据特点选择合适的算法</li>\n<li><strong>训练与调优</strong>：训练模型并进行超参数调优</li>\n<li><strong>评估验证</strong>：使用测试集评估模型性能</li>\n<li><strong>部署上线</strong>：将模型集成到生产环境</li>\n<li><strong>监控迭代</strong>：持续监控模型表现，根据新数据迭代</li>\n</ol>\n<hr>\n<h2 id=\"偏差-方差权衡\">偏差-方差权衡</h2><p>偏差-方差权衡（Bias-Variance Tradeoff）是机器学习中最核心的概念之一。模型的泛化误差可以分解为三部分：</p>\n<div class=\"math-block\"><span class=\"katex-display\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\" display=\"block\"><semantics><mrow><mtext>总误差</mtext><mo>=</mo><msup><mtext>偏差</mtext><mn>2</mn></msup><mo>+</mo><mtext>方差</mtext><mo>+</mo><mtext>不可约误差</mtext></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">\\text{总误差} = \\text{偏差}^2 + \\text{方差} + \\text{不可约误差}</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.6833em;\"></span><span class=\"mord text\"><span class=\"mord cjk_fallback\">总误差</span></span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span><span class=\"mrel\">=</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.9707em;vertical-align:-0.0833em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord text\"><span class=\"mord cjk_fallback\">偏差</span></span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.8873em;\"><span style=\"top:-3.1362em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\">2</span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span><span class=\"mbin\">+</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.7667em;vertical-align:-0.0833em;\"></span><span class=\"mord text\"><span class=\"mord cjk_fallback\">方差</span></span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span><span class=\"mbin\">+</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.6833em;\"></span><span class=\"mord text\"><span class=\"mord cjk_fallback\">不可约误差</span></span></span></span></span></span></div><table>\n<thead>\n<tr>\n<th>概念</th>\n<th>含义</th>\n<th>表现</th>\n</tr>\n</thead>\n<tbody><tr>\n<td>高偏差（欠拟合）</td>\n<td>模型过于简单，无法捕捉数据规律</td>\n<td>训练和测试误差都高</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>高方差（过拟合）</td>\n<td>模型过于复杂，记住了训练数据的噪声</td>\n<td>训练误差低，测试误差高</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>理想状态</td>\n<td>偏差和方差达到平衡</td>\n<td>训练和测试误差都较低</td>\n</tr>\n</tbody></table>\n<div class=\"code-block-wrapper\" data-lang=\"python\" data-code=\"import numpy as np&#10;from sklearn.preprocessing import PolynomialFeatures&#10;from sklearn.linear_model import LinearRegression&#10;from sklearn.metrics import mean_squared_error&#10;&#10;np.random.seed(42)&#10;X = np.sort(np.random.rand(30, 1) * 10, axis=0)&#10;y = np.sin(X).ravel() + np.random.randn(30) * 0.2&#10;&#10;for degree in [1, 4, 15]:&#10;    poly = PolynomialFeatures(degree=degree)&#10;    X_poly = poly.fit_transform(X)&#10;    model = LinearRegression().fit(X_poly, y)&#10;    y_pred = model.predict(X_poly)&#10;    mse = mean_squared_error(y, y_pred)&#10;    print(f&quot;多项式阶数 {degree:2d} → 训练 MSE: {mse:.4f}&quot;)\"><pre class=\"shiki shiki-themes github-light github-dark\" style=\"background-color:#fff;--shiki-dark-bg:#24292e;color:#24292e;--shiki-dark:#e1e4e8\" tabindex=\"0\"><code><span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">import</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> numpy </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">as</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> np</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">from</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> sklearn.preprocessing </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">import</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> PolynomialFeatures</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">from</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> sklearn.linear_model </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">import</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> LinearRegression</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">from</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> sklearn.metrics </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">import</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> mean_squared_error</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">np.random.seed(</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">42</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">)</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">X </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">=</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> np.sort(np.random.rand(</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">30</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">, </span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">1</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">) </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">*</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\"> 10</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">, </span><span style=\"color:#E36209;--shiki-dark:#FFAB70\">axis</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">=</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">0</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">)</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">y </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">=</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> np.sin(X).ravel() </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">+</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> np.random.randn(</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">30</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">) </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">*</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\"> 0.2</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">for</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> degree </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">in</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> [</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">1</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">, </span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">4</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">, </span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">15</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">]:</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">    poly </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">=</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> PolynomialFeatures(</span><span style=\"color:#E36209;--shiki-dark:#FFAB70\">degree</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">=</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">degree)</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">    X_poly </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">=</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> poly.fit_transform(X)</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">    model </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">=</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> LinearRegression().fit(X_poly, y)</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">    y_pred </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">=</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> model.predict(X_poly)</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">    mse </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">=</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> mean_squared_error(y, y_pred)</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">    print</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">(</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">f</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">\"多项式阶数 </span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">{</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">degree</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">:2d</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">}</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\"> → 训练 MSE: </span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">{</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">mse</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">:.4f</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">}</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">\"</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">)</span></span></code></pre></div><pre class=\"mermaid\" data-diagram-type=\"flowchart\" data-source=\"flowchart LR&#10;    subgraph 偏差-方差权衡&#10;        A[&quot;模型复杂度 ↑&quot;]&#10;        A --&gt; B[&quot;偏差 ↓&quot;]&#10;        A --&gt; C[&quot;方差 ↑&quot;]&#10;        B --&gt; D[&quot;欠拟合风险 ↓&quot;]&#10;        C --&gt; E[&quot;过拟合风险 ↑&quot;]&#10;    end\">flowchart LR\n    subgraph 偏差-方差权衡\n        A[\"模型复杂度 ↑\"]\n        A --&gt; B[\"偏差 ↓\"]\n        A --&gt; C[\"方差 ↑\"]\n        B --&gt; D[\"欠拟合风险 ↓\"]\n        C --&gt; E[\"过拟合风险 ↑\"]\n    end</pre><blockquote>\n<p><strong>提示：</strong> 实践中，通过交叉验证选择合适的模型复杂度，是解决偏差-方差权衡的有效方法。</p>\n</blockquote>\n<hr>\n<h2 id=\"小结\">小结</h2><ul>\n<li>机器学习是让计算机从数据中自动学习规律的方法，分为<strong>监督学习、无监督学习和强化学习</strong>三大类型。</li>\n<li>完整的 ML 工作流程包括问题定义、数据处理、特征工程、模型训练、评估和部署等环节。</li>\n<li><strong>偏差-方差权衡</strong>是理解模型泛化能力的核心框架，过简单导致欠拟合，过复杂导致过拟合。</li>\n<li>选择合适的模型复杂度并通过交叉验证进行验证，是构建可靠 ML 系统的关键。</li>\n</ul>\n","headings":[{"level":1,"text":"机器学习概览","id":"机器学习概览"},{"level":2,"text":"什么是机器学习","id":"什么是机器学习"},{"level":2,"text":"核心概念","id":"核心概念"},{"level":2,"text":"机器学习的三大类型","id":"机器学习的三大类型"},{"level":3,"text":"监督学习","id":"监督学习"},{"level":3,"text":"无监督学习","id":"无监督学习"},{"level":3,"text":"强化学习","id":"强化学习"},{"level":2,"text":"机器学习工作流程","id":"机器学习工作流程"},{"level":2,"text":"偏差-方差权衡","id":"偏差-方差权衡"},{"level":2,"text":"小结","id":"小结"}],"prev":null,"next":{"title":"监督学习","url":"/l-doc-books/h/ai-llm/machine-learning/foundations/supervised-learning"}}